  "details": "After unintentionally deeply upsetting someone last night thanks to them getting locked out of the group, it's unacceptable that quest users cannot follow to at least continue to speak to the  people they were with. \nI know it falls on other world creators to upload a quest version but that simply isn't happening enough. \nAn automatically generated, automatically uploaded static mesh that is simply a representation of the collision mesh in grayscale with a single directional light would solve that problem.",
